_Neutra_Rece_3000_4000_6000K_Alb_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_4.png?v=1788532926","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68422294405387,"created_at":"2026-04-22T11:58:09+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-04T17:22:27+03:00","product_id":10840749539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_Suspendata_Acril_UNDA_Infinity_36W_Lumina_Calda_Neutra_Rece_3000_4000_6000K_Alb_Auriu_Inaltime_Reglabila_8.svg?v=1788531747","width":136,"height":272}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10792977334539,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda Hortensia 190W Dimabila Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-hortensia-190w-dimabila-alb","body_html":"","published_at":"2026-06-30T03:05:26+03:00","created_at":"2025-10-30T15:50:40+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Aplicate","tags":["All Stock","BF2025","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","outlet"],"variants":[{"id":52540615950603,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-MV1A-HT2L-815","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"179.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"179.99","position":1,"product_id":10792977334539,"created_at":"2025-10-30T15:50:41+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":61856031408395,"created_at":"2025-10-30T15:52:01+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-10-30T15:52:06+02:00","product_id":10792977334539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Screenshot2025-10-30at15.51.56.png?v=1761832326","width":1052,"height":1030},{"id":61856032784651,"created_at":"2025-10-30T15:52:15+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-10-30T15:52:19+02:00","product_id":10792977334539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Screenshot2025-10-30at15.52.10.png?v=1761832339","width":1066,"height":888}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10896981360907,"title":"Lustra LED pentru copii MOTO, Tip motocicleta, 40W, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Albastru Alb","handle":"lustra-led-pentru-copii-moto-tip-motocicleta-40w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-albastru-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eLustra LED MOTO are un corp de iluminat modern cu design tematic in forma de motocicleta, perfect pentru camera copiilor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEste realizata din \u003cstrong\u003eacril si metal\u003c\/strong\u003e, cu finisaj \u003cstrong\u003ealbastru\u003c\/strong\u003e, si se monteaza aplicat pe \u003cstrong\u003etavan\u003c\/strong\u003e. Functioneaza la o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e40W \u003c\/strong\u003esi ofera un flux luminos de \u003cstrong data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"273\"\u003e3200 lm\u003c\/strong\u003e, fiind echipata cu banda LED si autonomie de \u003cstrong data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"329\"\u003e25.000h\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensiunile acesteia sunt \u003cstrong\u003e80\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"369\"\u003e cm lungime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"404\" data-start=\"388\"\u003e 60 cm latime\u003c\/strong\u003e si \u003cstrong data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"408\"\u003e15 cm inaltime\u003c\/strong\u003e, avand clasa de protectie \u003cstrong data-end=\"461\" data-start=\"453\"\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e si alimentare la \u003cstrong data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"479\"\u003e220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmite lumina \u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"506\"\u003erece\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"525\" data-start=\"516\"\u003ecalda\u003c\/strong\u003e si \u003cstrong data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"529\"\u003eneutra\u003c\/strong\u003e, fiind ideala pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"561\"\u003einterior\u003c\/strong\u003e, in special pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"613\" data-start=\"593\"\u003ecamera copilului\u003c\/strong\u003e sau \u003cstrong data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"618\"\u003edormitor\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-30T10:35:02+03:00","created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:27+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Copii","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre Copii","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52936709243147,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-CP1127BU","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"399.79","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"499.99","position":1,"product_id":10896981360907,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:28+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":66532354818315,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:51+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-02-27T17:55:25+02:00","product_id":10896981360907,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hecfdd02606064d8284b7f13ec8f4bdbdz.jpg?v=1772207725","width":800,"height":800},{"id":66532354720011,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:51+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-04-30T17:09:48+03:00","product_id":10896981360907,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/candelabru-led-elbulgaria---wheels-2650-bl--52w1xe141xmr11--albastru-37.jpg?v=1777558188","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":66532354785547,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:51+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-04-30T17:05:37+03:00","product_id":10896981360907,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/candelabru-led-elbulgaria---wheels-2650-bl--52w1xe141xmr11--albastru-32.jpg?v=1777557937","width":4500,"height":4500},{"id":66532354752779,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:52:51+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-04-30T17:07:20+03:00","product_id":10896981360907,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/candelabru-led-elbulgaria---wheels-2650-bl--52w1xe141xmr11--albastru-33.jpg?v=1777558040","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68727262576907,"created_at":"2026-05-06T16:54:35+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-06T16:56:30+03:00","product_id":10896981360907,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hecfdd02606064d8284b7f13ec8f4bdbdz_cdbd1402-7828-49fc-ab19-f86f9d95fddf.jpg?v=1778075790","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760618414347,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda RIGA LILITH 34W, 2 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-riga-lilith-34w-2-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/17._BANNER_c336037f-da7b-4b57-92b6-7debfd2fb91d.png?v=1778580286\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEleganță Circulară și Control Luminos Modern: Lustra LED cu Telecomandă\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eÎmbracă-ți spațiul cu un design contemporan și o iluminare versatilă cu lustra LED RIGA LILITH. Structura sa elegantă, compusă din \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003edouă cercuri\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e concentrice sau suprapuse, finisate într-o nuanță sofisticată de \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003enegru\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, adaugă o notă de stil modern și îndrăzneț oricărei încăperi.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e34\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eW\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, această lustră LED oferă o iluminare eficientă și amplă, perfectă pentru livinguri, dininguri, dormitoare sau birouri moderne. Datorită \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003etelecomenzii incluse\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, ai control total asupra atmosferei luminoase. Poți alege între \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003elumină rece\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare; \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003elumină caldă\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, perfectă pentru a crea un ambient primitor și relaxant; și \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003elumină neutră\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, potrivită pentru iluminatul general de zi cu zi.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eFuncția \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003edimabilă\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminoasă, creând astfel ambientul perfect pentru fiecare moment, de la o lumină strălucitoare la o lumină ambientală subtilă.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eDesign Modern și Elegant:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Două cercuri concentrice\/suprapuse cu finisaj negru.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003ePutere Eficientă:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e 34W pentru o iluminare optimă a spațiilor medii.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eTelecomandă Inclusă:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Control facil al temperaturii culorii și intensității luminoase.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eTrei Temperaturi de Culoare:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Rece, Caldă și Neutră, pentru a se potrivi oricărei ocazii.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eFuncție Dimabilă:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Ajustează intensitatea luminoasă pentru a crea ambientul dorit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eMateriale de Calitate:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Metal durabil cu finisaj negru elegant și elemente LED integrate.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eStil Contemporan și Îndrăzneț:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioarele moderne, industriale sau minimaliste.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eControl Total al Luminii:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Ajustează temperatura culorii și intensitatea cu telecomanda.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eAtmosferă Personalizată:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Creează ambientul perfect pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eAspect Estetic Plăcut:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Designul circular și finisajul negru adaugă un plus de stil modern și sofisticat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eUșor de Utilizat:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Telecomanda intuitivă face controlul luminii simplu și confortabil.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eIluminare Amplă:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e Potrivită pentru iluminarea eficientă a diverselor spații.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă 