00235,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL802_2BK.webp?v=1771773524","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9756791177483,"title":"Lustra LED VERTEX Matrix, Romburi Suprapuse, Rame Metalice, 24W, 2 Romburi, Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra 3000K\/4000K\/6000K, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-vertex-matrix-romburi-suprapuse-rame-metalice-11w-2-romburi-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"91\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Banner_e5470101-8559-4d4f-b7c1-46226109fe92.jpg?v=1773113728\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"91\"\u003eLustra LED VERTEX Matrix este un corp de iluminat modern, cu design geometric clar, bazat pe două romburi suprapuse și rame metalice. Estetica minimalistă și finisajul alb o fac potrivită pentru interioare contemporane, unde se caută linii curate și un aspect ordonat.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"91\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/IN_VS_LED.jpg?v=1773087323\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"91\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"676\"\u003eIluminarea LED integrată de 24W permite selectarea temperaturii de culoare caldă, neutră sau rece (3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K), adaptând lumina în funcție de activitate și momentul zilei. Lumina este distribuită uniform, oferind confort vizual și eficiență energetică.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"676\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL580WH_6_055f6d47-97dc-4a3b-b177-cebd8e6b330f.png?v=1769692491\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"892\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eDesignul compact și structura metalică conferă stabilitate și durabilitate, iar forma geometrică adaugă un accent decorativ discret. Lustra VERTEX Matrix este o soluție practică și estetică pentru livinguri, dormitoare, birouri sau holuri moderne.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"892\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL580WH_7.png?v=1769692419\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"892\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ccenter\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"892\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL580WH_5_24114536-8cd5-411e-993d-fb3bcff2c58e.png?v=1769700090\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/center\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"892\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ccenter\u003e\n\u003ciframe width=\"100%\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/ONXxGb8gAL4\" title=\"Lustra LED VERTEX Matrix 11W Lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/center\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T11:53:49+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T11:53:49+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave"],"variants":[{"id":52423619707147,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL580WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"69.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"79.99","position":1,"product_id":9756791177483,"created_at":"2025-09-29T09:25:14+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":67093611151627,"created_