3e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/15._Cover_content_b98d6f5e-14f3-4106-9f16-9659ea465991.jpg?v=1772924293\" alt=\"\"\u003eLustra Suspendata FAUSTO II – Iluminare Moderna pentru Spatiul Tau\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:210\"\u003eLustra FAUSTO II ofera un design contemporan, integrandu-se armonios in living, bucatarie sau zona de dining. Fabricata din acril si metal cu finisaj auriu, forma sa circulara aduce o nota de eleganta discreta.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:210\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/IN_VS_LED.png?v=1772904965\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:44\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii pentru amenajare si utilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"11:1-15:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:270\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLumina adaptabila:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o singura sursa de lumina LED de 42W, ai posibilitatea de a schimba atmosfera. Poti alege intre o lumina calda (3000K) pentru relaxare, o lumina neutra (4000K) pentru activitatile zilnice, sau o lumina rece (6000K) pentru o claritate sporita.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:200\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrare usoara in design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu un diametru de 50 cm si o inaltime ajustabila de 100 cm, FAUSTO II se potriveste bine in spatii de diferite dimensiuni, oferind flexibilitate la montajul pe tavan.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-15:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficienta pe termen lung:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sursa de iluminat LED are o durata de viata estimata la 25.000 de ore, asigurand o functionare indelungata si un consum redus de energie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:137\"\u003eFAUSTO II este o optiune practica si estetica pentru iluminatul interior, conceputa pentru a oferi confort si functionalitate in casa ta.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-09T11:34:31+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-09T11:27:39+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52428749799691,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT370\/50GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"739.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"739.99","position":1,"product_id":10226861539595,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:28:29+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":66990574698763,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:03+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T00:59:53+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/1._Cover_768ec84b-ca86-4667-92f2-8d0b01843358.jpg?v=1772924393","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990574469387,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:57:55+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T00:59:53+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/6._Detail_2.jpg?v=1772924393","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990574436619,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:57:55+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T00:59:53+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/3._Size.jpg?v=1772924393","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990574633227,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:02+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T00:59:53+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/2._3-Tone_Control.jpg?v=1772924393","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990580826379,"created_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:17+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:39+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT1204GD.jpg?v=1772924499","width":4000,"height":4000},{"id":66990574502155,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:57:56+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/5._Detail_1.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990574895371,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:05+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/7._Detail_3.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990575026443,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:08+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/10._Place_3.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990575091979,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:08+02:00","position":9,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/11._Place_4.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990575124747,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:08+02:00","position":10,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8._Place_1.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":66990575059211,"created_at":"2026-03-08T00:58:08+02:00","position":11,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/9._Place_2.jpg?v=1772924497","width":3999,"height":3999},{"id":62528534479115,"created_at":"2025-11-20T16:33:39+02:00","position":12,"updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:01:37+02:00","product_id":10226861539595,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT370_50GD_EPREL.png?v=1772924497","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10730363552011,"title":"Lustra LED, 51W, Diametru 50cm, Lumina Calda\/Rece\/Neutra, Alb","handle":"plafoniera-led-pl101-500wh-51w-diametru-50cm-lumina-calda-rece-neutra-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003ePlafoniera LED \u003cstrong\u003ePL101\/500WH\u003c\/strong\u003e aduce un design modern și minimalist, cu finisaj \u003cstrong\u003ealb elegant\u003c\/strong\u003e, ideal pentru interioare luminoase. Cu \u003cstrong\u003e51W LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare eficientă și uniformă, disponibilă pe trei trepte de temperatură a luminii: \u003cstrong\u003e3000K (caldă), 4000K (neutră), 6000K (rece)\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 51W LED integrat\u003cbr\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e Diametru 50 cm\u003cbr\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K\u003cbr\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + Acril\u003cbr\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eFinisaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alb modern\u003cbr\u003e✔ \u003cstrong\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Living, dormitor, dining, birou, spații moderne\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAceastă plafonieră LED combină \u003cstrong\u003eeficiența energetică\u003c\/strong\u003e cu un design elegant, fiind soluția ideală pentru iluminarea contemporană a casei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-11-20T12:58:16+02:00","created_at":"2025-09-22T13:57:37+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Plafoniere LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Plafoniere LED"],"variants":[{"id":52412038840587,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-PL101\/500WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"119.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":10730363552011,"created_at":"2025-09-25T15:53:12+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":60559274967307,"created_at":"2025-09-22T14:00:53+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:07:53+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_1.jpg?v=1787317673","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":60559274934539,"created_at":"2025-09-22T14:00:53+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:08:03+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_2.jpg?v=1787317683","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":60559274869003,"created_at":"2025-09-22T14:00:53+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:08:11+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_3.jpg?v=1787317691","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":60559274901771,"created_at":"2025-09-22T14:00:53+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:08:25+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_4H2fa891d9636a4498bbe87b316e3d3b3bd.jpg?v=1787317705","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":60559275000075,"created_at":"2025-09-22T14:00:53+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:08:33+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_5.jpg?v=1787317713","width":1000,"height":1000},{"id":65645124223243,"created_at":"2026-02-12T17:51:19+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T16:02:40+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_6.webp?v=1788872560","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":62880824787211,"created_at":"2025-11-30T13:53:39+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:08:49+03:00","product_id":10730363552011,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Plafoniera_LED_51W_Diametru_50cm_Lumina_Calda_Rece_Neutra_Alb_7.png?v=1787317729","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9760666190091,"title":"Lustra LED cu cristal ARABELA 40W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-cristal-arabela-40w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:84\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEleganță Modernă și Strălucire Cristalină Adaptabilă: Lustra LED Cristal Arabela\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:368\"\u003eÎmbracă-ți spațiul cu un rafinament contemporan și o lumină versatilă cu lustra LED Cristal Arabela. Designul său modern îmbină armonios elemente \u003cstrong\u003ealbe\u003c\/strong\u003e și \u003cstrong\u003enegre\u003c\/strong\u003e într-o structură elegantă, accentuată de strălucirea captivantă a cristalelor de înaltă calitate. Această combinație cromatică oferă un contrast sofisticat și un punct focal luminos în orice încăpere.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:532\"\u003eCu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e40W\u003c\/strong\u003e, această lustră LED oferă o iluminare eficientă și adaptabilă oricărei atmosfere. Bucură-te de posibilitatea de a alege între \u003cstrong\u003elumină rece\u003c\/strong\u003e, ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare, \u003cstrong\u003elumină caldă\u003c\/strong\u003e, perfectă pentru a crea un ambient primitor și relaxant, și \u003cstrong\u003elumină neutră\u003c\/strong\u003e, potrivită pentru iluminatul general de zi cu zi. Deși descrierea nu menționează o telecomandă, este posibil ca schimbarea temperaturii culorii să se facă printr-un comutator clasic sau alt mecanism specific produsului.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:267\"\u003eCristalele atent șlefuite refractă lumina în mod spectaculos, creând jocuri de lumină fascinante și adăugând o notă de lux subtil oricărei încăperi. Contrastul dintre structura alb-negru și strălucirea clară a cristalelor adaugă un plus de modernitate și sofisticare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:25\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici Cheie:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"13:1-19:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:91\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Modern și Elegant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Structură alb-negru contrastantă cu cristale strălucitoare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:72\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere Eficientă:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40W pentru o iluminare optimă a spațiilor medii.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:160\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrei Temperaturi de Culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lumină Rece, Caldă și Neutră, pentru a se potrivi oricărei ocazii. (Verifică modalitatea de schimbare a temperaturii culorii)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:90\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEfect Strălucitor:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cristalele de înaltă calitate refractă lumina în mod spectaculos.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:99\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de Calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal durabil cu finisaje elegante (alb și negru) și cristale premium.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"18:1-19:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStil Versatil:\u003c\/strong\u003e Se integrează perfect în interioare moderne, minimaliste sau cu accente glamour.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:14\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeneficii:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"22:1-27:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:118\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCreează un Punct Focal Elegant și Modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designul contrastant și strălucirea cristalelor atrag toate privirile.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"23:1-23:110\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOferă o Atmosferă Luminoasă și Adaptabilă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alege temperatura de culoare potrivită pentru fiecare moment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:79\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eÎmbogățește Decorul:\u003c\/strong\u003e Strălucirea cristalelor adaugă o notă de lux subtil.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:81\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficiență Energetică LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață lungă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"26:1-27:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUșor de Integrat:\u003c\/strong\u003e Combinația de alb și negru este versatilă și se potrivește în diverse scheme de culori.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:225\"\u003eLustra LED Cristal Arabela este alegerea ideală pentru a adăuga un plus de eleganță modernă, strălucire adaptabilă și un contrast sofisticat în casa ta. Bucură-te de frumusețea cristalelor și de versatilitatea iluminării LED!\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:225\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:40+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:40+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52424801288459,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL402","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"69.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"69.99","position":1,"product_id":9760666190091,"created_at":"2025-09-29T17:36:06+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":55046955958539,"created_at":"2025-04-28T17:06:52+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-28T17:06:55+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-Ll402-LustraLEDCristal_Arabela_35WLuminaRece_Calda_NeutraAlbNegru-1.png?v=1745849215","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":51852849545483,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:43+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-05-22T11:51:18+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-arabela-40w-alb_LL219_04.webp?v=1747903878","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51852849971467,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:43+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-05-22T11:51:18+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-arabela-40w-alb_LL219_01.webp?v=1747903878","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51852850266379,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:43+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-05-22T11:51:18+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-arabela-40w-alb_LL219_02.webp?v=1747903878","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51852851020043,"created_at":"2025-02-25T03:04:43+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-05-22T11:51:18+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-arabela-40w-alb_LL219_03.webp?v=1747903878","width":900,"height":900},{"id":55046954647819,"created_at":"2025-04-28T17:06:44+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-04-28T17:06:54+03:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-Ll402-LustraLEDCristal_Arabela_35WLuminaRece_Calda_NeutraAlbNegru-2.png?v=1745849214","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":63187547193611,"created_at":"2025-12-09T13:43:11+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-12-09T13:43:14+02:00","product_id":9760666190091,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL402_EPREL.png?v=1765280594","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757935632651,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda ORBITA 74W, 3 Elemente, Ovala, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-orbita-74w-3-elemente-ovala-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eORBITA \u003c\/strong\u003eeste o lustra LED cu design contemporan, formată din 3 elemente ovale interconectate, ce creează un efect vizual fluid și elegant. Finisajul negru mat îi oferă un aspect minimalist, potrivit atât pentru interioare moderne, cât și pentru amenajări industriale sau minimaliste.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 74W\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTip lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece \/ Caldă \/ Neutră (selectabilă)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFuncție dimare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Da – intensitate reglabilă din telecomandă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eControl:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomandă inclusă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e 86.5 x 61.5 x 6.5 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCuloare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Negru\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMontaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e aplicat pe tavan\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAvantaje principale\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e✔ Control complet al temperaturii de culoare – adaptezi atmosfera în funcție de momentul zilei\u003cbr\u003e✔ Intensitate reglabilă – ideală pentru ambient relaxant sau lumină puternică de lucru\u003cbr\u003e✔ Design modern cu impact vizual\u003cbr\u003e✔ Consum redus de energie datorită tehnologiei LED\u003cbr\u003e✔ Distribuție uniformă a luminii\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrin combinația dintre formă geometrică elegantă și funcționalitate avansată, \u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED ORBITA 74W\u003c\/strong\u003e devine un element central al încăperii, oferind atât estetică premium, cât și confort vizual optim.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T