tyle=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Este atât de ușor să controlezi atmosfera.”\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eIn materie de \u003cstrong\u003edesign interior\u003c\/strong\u003e, tendintele par sa se schimbe tot mai des. Totusi, nu este dificil sa tii pasul cu acestea, mai ales atunci cand ai sansa de a integra un corp de iluminat modern in casa ta, ce are capacitatea de a schimba in totalitate un intreg decor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED BLOSSOM \u003c\/strong\u003eeste excelenta pentru orice camera din locuinta, aceasta reusind sa distribuie uniform lumina si sa contureze totodata multitudinea de obiecte de decor sau mobilier. Freira face parte dintr-o gama complexa de lustre cu design minimalist, regasite in diverse forme si cu un numar diferit de surse de iluminat, disponibile pentru orice tip de incapere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTehnologia LED\u003c\/strong\u003e ce sta la baza functionarii acesteia este in topul preferintelor celor ce doresc sa reduca semnificativ consumul de energie, LED-urile fiind de 10 ori mai eficiente decat becurile clasice. De asemenea, autonomia impresionanta ce insumeaza \u003cstrong\u003e25 000h\u003c\/strong\u003e garanteaza un iluminat indelungat, fara eventuale intreruperi.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePosibilitatea de a fi \u003cstrong\u003econtrolata prin intermediul unei telecomenzi\u003c\/strong\u003e, reprezinta un avantaj major in fata lustrelor clasice. Astfel, \u003cstrong\u003epoti regla tipul de lumina dispersat\u003c\/strong\u003e (calda-3000k, neutra-4000k si rece-6000k), dar \u003cstrong\u003esi intensitatea acesteia\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:56+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:56+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52426228793611,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT260\/6WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"199.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"179.99","position":1,"product_id":9757518987531,"created_at":"2025-09-30T02:55:30+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":59128647090443,"created_at":"2025-08-14T17:36:23+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_1_7b0e49a6-7929-4f39-b54e-c27aae4a9a6b.png?v=1755182272","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":59128651088139,"created_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:00+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_bdcb720d-9674-4141-968b-98a1444b573e.png?v=1755182272","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":59124788101387,"created_at":"2025-08-14T11:32:24+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_f66fd76d-8ac5-4ae6-8e87-5eeb6a8e3d8c.png?v=1755182272","width":1500,"height":1500},{"id":51816160362763,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:58+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-jessica-140w-alb-acril-dimabila_LL160_04.webp?v=1755182272","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816160329995,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:58+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-jessica-140w-alb-acril-dimabila_LL160_01.webp?v=1755182272","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816160231691,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:58+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-jessica-140w-alb-acril-dimabila_LL160_02.webp?v=1755182272","width":900,"height":900},{"id":59128649318667,"created_at":"2025-08-14T17:36:46+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_ee59ea6f-a03a-4005-b819-b16531f6b44b.png?v=1755182272","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":51816160461067,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:38:58+02:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2025-08-14T17:37:52+03:00","product_id":9757518987531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-jessica-140w-alb-acril-dimabila_LL160_03.webp?v=1755182272","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757536387339,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda LYRA 248W, 5 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu Periat","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-lyra-248w-5-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-auriu-periat","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Este atât de ușor să controlezi atmosfera.”\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustrele LED  LYRA\u003c\/strong\u003e sunt recunoscute pentru formele si nuantele deosebite, ce contureaza un corp de iluminat impunator, menit sa emane opulenta si rafinament fiecarui privitor. Totusi, pe langa aspectul demn de admiratie, este necesar sa precizam si faptul ca sunt extrem de \u003cstrong\u003eeficiente\u003c\/strong\u003e. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eCaracterizate de o \u003cstrong\u003eautonomie ce insumeaza 25 000h\u003c\/strong\u003e, acestea pot dispersa lumina pentru o lunga perioada de timp, ghidandu-ti pasii indiferent de moment pentru a duce la bun sfarsit fiecare activitate. De asemenea, fiind bazate pe \u003cstrong\u003etehnologia LED\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustrele sunt intruchiparea eficientei, producand o doza insemnata de lumina, in schimbul unui cost mult mai redus, comparativ cu becurile clasice.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eDaca pui confortul pe primul loc, trebuie sa stii ca \u003cstrong\u003elustrele LED  LYRA \u003c\/strong\u003esunt exact ce ai nevoie pentru a avea parte de cea mai relaxanta experienta, chiar la tine acasa! Posibilitatea de a fi \u003cstrong\u003econtrolate prin intermediul telecomenzii\u003c\/strong\u003e reprezinta un avantaj major in comparatie cu lustrele obisnuite, avand in vedere ca datorita acesteia, atat \u003cstrong\u003eintensitatea\u003c\/strong\u003e cat si \u003cstrong\u003etipul de lumina\u003c\/strong\u003e dispersat (calda-3000k, neutra-4000k si rece-6000k) pot fi schimbate cu usurinta.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:47:55+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:47:54+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52408137384203,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-162\/5","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"605.01","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"605.01","position":1,"product_id":9757536387339,"created_at":"2025-09-24T12:23:26+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51816302084363,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:47:59+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:48:01+02:00","product_id":9757536387339,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-naima-248w-auriu-acril-dimabila_LL76AU_01.webp?v=1740408481","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816302346507,"created_at":"202