olina-168w-dimabila-alb-negru_LL192_03.webp?v=1752477876","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757542580491,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda MYRENE 110W, 2 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-myrene-110w-2-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e“Este atât de ușor să controlezi atmosfera.”\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eUn moment-cheie în procesul decorării unei încăperi este cel în care alegi lustra potrivită. Dimensiunile, designul, materialele de fabricare, sursele de iluminare și destinația de amplasare sunt factorii principali de care ai nevoie să ții cont pentru alegerea lustrei perfecte.      \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eCu lustrele LED, posibilitățile de iluminare decorativă devin nelimitate! Suntem conștienți de acest lucru, așa că alegem să comercializăm doar lustre LED de cea mai bună calitate și îți punem la dispoziție un portofoliu extins din care să alegi.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:49+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:49+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52365339787531,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-XD195\/2AU","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"352.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"352.00","position":1,"product_id":9757542580491,"created_at":"2025-09-13T13:16:15+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51816341471499,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:51+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757542580491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-myrene-110w-auriu-dimabila-1684564708.webp?v=1740408653","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816341569803,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:51+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:54+02:00","product_id":9757542580491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-myrene-110w-auriu-dimabila_LL198_02.webp?v=1740408654","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816341045515,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:52+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757542580491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-myrene-110w-auriu-dimabila_LL198_04.webp?v=1740408653","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816341438731,"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:52+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757542580491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra-LED-cu-Telecomanda-Myrene_-110W_-Auriu_-Dimabil_C4_83-1684564708.webp?v=1740408653","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757594386699,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda si cristal TEATRU 36W, 3 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Crom Lucios, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-si-cristal-teatru-36w-3-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-crom-lucios-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:300\"\u003eLustra LED suspendată cu telecomandă și cristale TEATRU este o piesă de iluminat elegantă și modernă, cu o putere de 36W și un design format din trei cercuri finisate în crom lucios, împodobite cu cristale strălucitoare. Datorită înălțimii reglabile, se poate adapta diferitelor spații și preferințe.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:484\"\u003eCele trei cercuri crom lucios, decorate cu cristale, vor crea un efect luminos captivant, reflectând și refractând lumina LED integrată. Telecomanda inclusă îți oferă control asupra temperaturii culorii (rece, caldă sau neutră) și intensității luminii (dimabilă), permițându-ți să creezi atmosfera dorită. Finisajul crom lucios accentuează strălucirea cristalelor și adaugă o notă contemporană și sofisticată designului. Funcția de înălțime reglabilă oferă flexibilitate în instalare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:255\"\u003eCu o putere de 36W, este potrivită pentru a ilumina livinguri mai mici, dormitoare sau alte spații unde se dorește un element de design elegant și o sursă de lumină versatilă. Numele 'TEATRU' ar putea sugera un efect de iluminare dramatic sau strălucitor.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:20+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:19+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Cristal","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52038316523787,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-VV1A-HT2L-6040\/6+4+2","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"960.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"960.00","position":1,"product_id":9757594386699,"created_at":"2025-08-05T15:23:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51816668037387,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:22+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:24+02:00","product_id":9757594386699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-teatru-36x2w-crom-cristal-3000-4000-6000k_LL56AG_01.webp?v=1740409824","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816668070155,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:22+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:24+02:00","product_id":9757594386699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-teatru-36x2w-crom-cristal-3000-4000-6000k_LL56AG_02.webp?v=1740409824","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816667971851,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:22+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:10:24+02:00","product_id":9757594386699,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-teatru-36x2w-crom-cristal-3000-4000-6000k_LL56AG_03.webp?v=1740409824","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757636788491,"title":"Plafoniera LED cu telecomanda TIANA 78W, 3 Elipse, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-tiana-78w-3-elipse-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"containerimg-mobile\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eDescriere Lustră LED TIANA, 78W, Alb Mat, Acril și Metal, 3000K\/4000K\/6000K\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"iframe-container rounded-corner centered\"\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=2GuhyheFph0\" class=\"video-link\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/img.youtube.com\/vi\/2GuhyheFph0\/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\"\u003e \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e \u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă TIANA\u003c\/strong\u003e, de \u003cstrong\u003e78\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eW\u003c\/strong\u003e, aduce un design fluid și elegant în locuința ta, prin cele trei elipse interconectate, finisate într-un alb luminos. Această lustră nu este doar o sursă de lumină, ci și un element decorativ modern, oferind o iluminare versatilă prin posibilitatea de a alege între lumină \u003cstrong\u003erece\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003ecaldă \u003c\/strong\u003esau \u003cstrong\u003eneutră\u003c\/strong\u003e, adaptându-se astfel oricărei atmosfere sau activități. \u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFuncția de dimare\u003c\/strong\u003e, controlată cu ușurință prin telecomanda inclusă, îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a crea exact ambianța dorită. Designul său organic cu cele trei elipse albe o face ideală pentru livinguri, sufragerii sau alte spații în care se dorește un iluminat plăcut și un element de design sofisticat și aerisit. Cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e78\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eW\u003c\/strong\u003e, asigură o iluminare eficientă și generoasă a încăperii.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"paragrafe-text\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"containerimg\"\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\"\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:06+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:06+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52417284702475,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT282\/3WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"239.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"279.99","position":1,"product_id":9757636788491,"created_at":"2025-09-27T07:18:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":61567852970251,"created_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:05+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_ce76f826-11be-4109-a7ca-f4ee0b5d6d8a.png?v=1761119497","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":51816939618571,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:09+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-izotop-telecomanda-138w-dimabila-acril-alb_LL1838AL_05.webp?v=1761119497","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816939847947,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:09+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-izotop-telecomanda-138w-dimabila-acril-alb_LL1838AL_02.webp?v=1761119497","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816939782411,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:09+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-izotop-telecomanda-138w-dimabila-acril-alb_LL1838AL_01.webp?v=1761119497","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816939815179,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:09+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-izotop-telecomanda-138w-dimabila-acril-alb_LL1838AL_03.webp?v=1761119497","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51816939585803,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:26:09+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-10-22T10:51:37+03:00","product_id":9757636788491,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-izotop-telecomanda-138w-dimabila-acril-alb_LL1838AL_04.webp?v=1761119497","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757670801675,"title":"Lustra LED NEXA 3D 36W, Ovala, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra , Alb","handle":"lustra-led-nexa-3d-36w-ovala-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:358\"\u003eLustra LED NEXA Oval 3D este o piesă de iluminat modernă și cu un design distinctiv. Având o putere de 36W și un finisaj alb, probabil prezintă un efect vizual tridimensional datorită formei ovale sau a structurii sale. De asemenea, oferă posibilitatea de a alege între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, adaptându-se astfel diferitelor preferințe și necesități.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:287\"\u003eEfectul 3D al formei ovale ar putea crea un joc interesant de umbre și lumini, adăugând dinamism spațiului. Cu o putere de 36W, ar fi potrivită pentru a ilumina livinguri mai mici, dormitoare sau alte încăperi de dimensiuni similare. Finisajul alb îi conferă un aspect curat și versatil\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\" alt=\"\"\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-08T22:52:41+03:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:25+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Aplicate","tags":["Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","SUB50"],"variants":[{"id":52382812864779,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-MV1A-HT2L-4309","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"42.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"69.99","position":1,"product_id":9757670801675,"created_at":"2025-09-18T17:59:51+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51817112862987,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:27+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:29+02:00","product_id":9757670801675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolyn-36-w-3000-4000-6000-k-alb_LL125AL_04.webp?v=1740411509","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51817112928523,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:27+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:29+02:00","product_id":9757670801675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolyn-36-w-3000-4000-6000-k-alb_LL125AL_02.webp?v=1740411509","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51817112961291,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:27+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T17:38:29+02:00","product_id":9757670801675,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-carolyn-36-w-3000-4000-6000-k-alb_LL125AL_03.webp?v=1740411509","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757725294859,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda GLORIOSA 40W, 3 Petale, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-gloriosa-4w-3-petale-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003eDescopera o lustra LED moderna care redefineste iluminatul din casa ta, aducand impreuna eleganta unui design contemporan cu tehnologia avansata de iluminat. Cu aceasta lustra, vei avea control total asupra atmosferei din fiecare camera, transformand rapid spatiul in functie de momentul zilei sau activitate.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eDesign si Iluminare Moderna\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesignul contemporan in forma de floare, completat de finisajul alb premium, se integreaza perfect in orice interior modern. Cele 3 surse LED integrate ofera flexibilitate prin cele trei tipuri de lumina disponibile: de la lumina calda (3000K) perfecta pentru serile relaxante, la cea neutra (4000K) ideala pentru activitatile zilnice, si pana la lumina rece (6000K) care stimuleaza productivitatea. Cu o putere de iluminare de 8000 lumeni, distribuita uniform, lustra acopera optimal spatii de pana la 15mp, eliminand zonele intunecate si creand o atmosfera placuta.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eControl si Confort\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eSistemul de control intuitiv, accesibil prin telecomanda, iti permite sa ajustezi atat intensitatea cat si tipul de lumina cu usurinta. Tranzitiile line intre modurile de iluminare asigura un confort vizual maxim, fara schimbari bruste care sa deranjeze.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Screenshot_2025-03-15_at_15.57.59.png?v=1742047101\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEficienta si Durabilitate\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eTehnologia LED de ultima generatie ofera un consum redus de doar 40W, asigurand o economie de energie de pana la 75% fata de sistemele traditionale. Cu o durata de viata impresionanta de 25.000 ore. Aceasta lustra reprezinta o investitie pe termen lung in confortul casei tale.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eVersatilitate in Utilizare\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdaptabilitatea este unul dintre punctele forte ale acestei lustre, fiind potrivita pentru multiple spatii, de la dormitor si bucatarie pana la dining sau camera copilului. Dimensiunile sale practice, cu un diametru de 60 cm si un profil subtire de doar 8 cm, o fac sa se integreze perfect in orice incapere moderna.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eInstalare si Siguranta\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eStandardul de protectie IP20 asigura functionarea sigura in mediul interior, in timp ce sistemul de montare simplificat face instalarea accesibila si rapida.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlege sa iti transformi casa intr-un spatiu modern si versatil cu aceasta lustra LED care imbina perfect designul contemporan cu tehnologia avansata, oferindu-ti control total asupra atmosferei din fiecare camera.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c!-- notionvc: 50938d34-9fbb-4a46-ad38-4c14d376ec90 --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:25+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:24+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52407078551819,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT296\/3WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"89.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"159.99","position":1,"product_id":9757725294859,"created_at":"2025-09-24T03:23:02+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51817467314443,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:27+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-03-16T13:11:16+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_01.webp?v=1742123476","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817467347211,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:28+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-03-16T13:11:16+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_05.webp?v=1742123476","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817466626315,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:27+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-03-16T13:11:06+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_02.webp?v=1742123466","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817466855691,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:27+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-03-16T13:11:06+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_03.webp?v=1742123466","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817467412747,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:28+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-03-16T13:11:06+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_04.webp?v=1742123466","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817467019531,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:28+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-03-14T23:40:28+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_06.webp?v=1741988428","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51817467379979,"created_at":"2025-02-24T17:56:28+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-03-14T23:40:28+02:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-telecomanda-narcisa-100w-dimabila-alb_LL1849AL_07.webp?v=1741988428","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":68426058367243,"created_at":"2026-04-22T14:36:43+03:00","position":8,"updated_at":"2026-04-22T14:36:46+03:00","product_id":9757725294859,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2698837_big_color.svg?v=1776857806","width":136,"height":272}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757778280715,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda ANINA 34W, 1 Cerc, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Negru, Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-anina-34w-1-cerc-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-negru-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda ANINA are o putere de \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e34W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e si utilizeaza \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ebanda LED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, oferind un flux luminos optim pentru spatii de interior. Lumina este \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edimabila\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, cu trei temperaturi de culoare disponibile: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K, 6000K\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (calda, neutra, rece). Functioneaza la \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, cu o autonomie de \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e25.000 ore\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, si se controleaza prin \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etelecomanda sau intrerupator clasic\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Designul este \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003emodern\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, in forma \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003erotunda\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, cu montaj \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003esuspendat pe tavan\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Corpul este realizat din \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003emetal si acril\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, finisaj \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003enegru\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, cu \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ediametru de 50 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e si \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003einaltime de 41 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Protectia este de tip \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP20\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Recomandata pentru \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003edormitor, baie, dressing sau bucatarie\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T18:17:28+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T18:17:27+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52425269346571,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT803\/1BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"189.99","position":1,"product_id":9757778280715,"created_at":"2025-09-29T20:25:34+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56562069930251,"created_at":"2025-06-19T11:19:41+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-19T11:19:54+03:00","product_id":9757778280715,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT8031BK-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaANINA33W_1Cerc_luminaReceCaldaNeutra_Dimabila_Negru_InaltimeReglabila-2.png?v=1750321194","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":51817881862411,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:17:30+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:26:01+03:00","product_id":9757778280715,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-casiana-telecomanda-50-w-negru-dimabila_LL264_04.webp?v=1757924761","width":900,"height":900},{"id":56562070159627,"created_at":"2025-06-19T11:19:41+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:26:01+03:00","product_id":9757778280715,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT8031BK-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaANINA33W_1Cerc_luminaReceCaldaNeutra_Dimabila_Negru_InaltimeReglabila-1.png?v=1757924761","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":51817881993483,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:17:30+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T11:26:01+03:00","product_id":9757778280715,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT8031BK-Lustra_LED_suspendata_cu_telecomanda_ANINA_33W_1_Cerc_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Dimabila_Negru_Inaltime_Reglabila-1.webp?v=1757924761","width":900,"height":900},{"id":63004263350539,"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:56:05+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:56:09+02:00","product_id":9757778280715,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT803_1BK_EPREL.png?v=1764856569","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757866590475,"title":"Lustra LED VERTEX CUBUS 13W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-vertex-cubus-13w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:143\"\u003eAceastă lustră LED VERTEX CUBUS, de 13W și culoare neagră, oferă o iluminare versatilă și un design cubic modern pentru locuința ta din .\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:30\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:79\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13W, ideală pentru iluminat ambiental sau pentru spații mai mici.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"6:1-6:139\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip de lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Reglabilă – poți alege între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, adaptând atmosfera în funcție de preferințe și activități.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:97\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign modern:\u003c\/strong\u003e Forma cubică și culoarea neagră conferă un aspect minimalist și contemporan.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:64\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlux luminos optim:\u003c\/strong\u003e Oferă o iluminare plăcută și uniformă.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:77\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTehnologie LED:\u003c\/strong\u003e Consum redus de energie și durată de viață îndelungată.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:84\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMateriale de calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Construcție robustă pentru o utilizare de lungă durată.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInstalare simplă:\u003c\/strong\u003e Vine cu toate accesoriile necesare și instrucțiuni clare.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:245\"\u003eAceastă lustră LED VERTEX CUBUS este o alegere excelentă pentru cei care caută o soluție de iluminat cu un design geometric simplu și elegant, oferind în același timp flexibilitatea de a alege temperatura culorii potrivită pentru fiecare moment.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:50+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:49+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave","SUB50"],"variants":[{"id":52424569717003,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-AL22BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"49.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"89.99","position":1,"product_id":9757866590475,"created_at":"2025-09-29T16:25:52+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51818415259915,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:51+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757866590475,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cubus-13w-lumina-rececaldaneutra-negru-acril-1738412943.webp?v=1740415853","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51818415325451,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:51+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757866590475,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cubus-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL1864N_02.webp?v=1740415853","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51818415227147,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:51+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:53+02:00","product_id":9757866590475,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-cubus-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL1864N_03.webp?v=1740415853","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757866918155,"title":"Lustra LED VERTEX GYRO 42W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-vertex-gyro-42w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă VERTEX GYRO, de 42W, este o piesă de iluminat cu un design modern și dinamic, finisată în negru. Numele 'GYRO' sugerează un aspect rotativ sau cu elemente care se învârt, adăugând un plus de originalitate. Această lustră oferă o iluminare versatilă, permițând alegerea între lumină rece, caldă sau neutră, pentru a se adapta diferitelor momente și preferințe. Deși în denumire nu se menționează explicit funcția de dimare, multe lustre LED cu telecomandă oferă această posibilitate, permițând reglarea intensității luminii. Finisajul negru îi conferă un aspect elegant și ușor de integrat în diverse stiluri de interior, în special cele moderne sau industriale. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:56+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:55+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustra LED","tags":["active","All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave","SUB50"],"variants":[{"id":52425308209419,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-AL21BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"49.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"89.99","position":1,"product_id":9757866918155,"created_at":"2025-09-29T20:45:48+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51818416144651,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:58+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:51:00+02:00","product_id":9757866918155,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-sferana-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL437_01.webp?v=1740415860","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51818416046347,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:59+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:51:00+02:00","product_id":9757866918155,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-sferana-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL437_02.webp?v=1740415860","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51818416210187,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:59+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:51:00+02:00","product_id":9757866918155,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-sferana-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL437_03.webp?v=1740415860","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51818416177419,"created_at":"2025-02-24T18:50:59+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T18:51:00+02:00","product_id":9757866918155,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-sferana-24w-3000-4000-6000k-negru-acril_LL437_04.webp?v=1740415860","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757933994251,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda BALANS 44W, 2 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-balans-44w-2-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 16px;\"\u003eDescriere Lustra LED cu Telecomandă Balans, 44W, Alb Mat\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; margin: auto;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"video-link\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=j3mIVKgwBqY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/img.youtube.com\/vi\/j3mIVKgwBqY\/maxresdefault.jpg\" style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; max-width: 640px; margin: auto;\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:217\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă BALANS\u003c\/strong\u003e este o piesă de iluminat modernă și echilibrată, cu un design format din două pătrate stilizate, finisate în alb. Cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e44W\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare versatilă pentru diverse spații.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:529\"\u003eCele două pătrate albe, dispuse probabil într-o manieră care sugerează un echilibru vizual (fie alăturate, suprapuse parțial, sau poate unul deasupra celuilalt), sunt iluminate de LED-uri cu posibilitatea de a selecta temperatura culorii. Prin intermediul telecomenzii, poți alege între lumină \u003cstrong\u003erece \u003c\/strong\u003e(pentru un ambient energizant), \u003cstrong\u003ecaldă \u003c\/strong\u003e(pentru o atmosferă primitoare și relaxantă) sau \u003cstrong\u003eneutră \u003c\/strong\u003e(pentru iluminare generală). Funcția de dimare îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a se potrivi perfect oricărui moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:231\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinisajul alb\u003c\/strong\u003e al lustrei accentuează liniile moderne ale designului pătrat și adaugă o notă de puritate și luminozitate încăperii. Cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e44W\u003c\/strong\u003e, este ideală pentru a ilumina livinguri mai mici, dormitoare, holuri sau birouri.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:231\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:21+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:20+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","outlet"],"variants":[{"id":52424354627851,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT804\/2WH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"49.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"119.99","position":1,"product_id":9757933994251,"created_at":"2025-09-29T14:58:06+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51819196219659,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:28+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_11.webp?v=1740418588","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196154123,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:27+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_02.webp?v=1740418587","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196121355,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:27+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_03.webp?v=1740418587","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196252427,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:28+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_04.webp?v=1740418588","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196055819,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:27+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_05.webp?v=1740418587","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196285195,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:28+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_06.webp?v=1740418588","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819196088587,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:25+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:27+02:00","product_id":9757933994251,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-balans-telecomanda-48w-24ghz-acril-3000k-4000k-6000k-dimabila-alb_LL224_07.webp?v=1740418587","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9757934846219,"title":"Lustra LED PULSARIS 27W, 2 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru","handle":"lustra-led-pulsaris-27w-2-patrate-lumina-calda-neutra-rece-negru","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eLustră LED Pulsaris - Eleganță Modernă și Lumină Clară\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eAdaugă un plus de stil contemporan și o iluminare eficientă în spațiul tău cu lustra LED Pulsaris. Designul său modern, realizat din \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eacril\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e de înaltă calitate cu un finisaj \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003enegru\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e elegant, aduce un aer sofisticat și minimalist oricărei încăperi.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:181\"\u003eCu o putere eficientă de \u003cstrong\u003e27W\u003c\/strong\u003e, lustra \u003cstrong\u003ePULSARIS \u003c\/strong\u003eoferă o iluminare uniformă și plăcută. Bucură-te de flexibilitatea \u003cstrong\u003etrei tipuri de lumină\u003c\/strong\u003e integrate, adaptabile oricărei atmosfere:\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"9:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:80\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRece (alb):\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru activități care necesită concentrare și energie.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:95\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCaldă (galben):\u003c\/strong\u003e Creează un ambient primitor și relaxant, perfect pentru serile liniștite.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"11:1-12:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNeutră:\u003c\/strong\u003e O lumină echilibrată, potrivită pentru utilizarea zilnică.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eConstrucția din \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eacril\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e nu doar conferă un aspect modern, ci și asigură o difuzie uniformă a luminii, eliminând umbrele dure și creând un ambient plăcut. Finisajul \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003enegru\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e adaugă un contrast elegant și se integrează ușor în diverse stiluri de decor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eCu un indice de protecție \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003eIP20\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"selected\"\u003e, lustra Pulsaris este potrivită pentru utilizare în interior, în zone uscate.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:53+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:53+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","All Stock","ciresar","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","SUB50"],"variants":[{"id":52424030617867,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL801\/2BK","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"69.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"69.99","position":1,"product_id":9757934846219,"created_at":"2025-09-29T13:05:49+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":62340497801483,"created_at":"2025-11-14T14:15:52+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:16:03+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_a8735114-c80f-46f9-bc35-a0cbb18b59ec.png?v=1763122563","width":1800,"height":1800},{"id":51819202085131,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:55+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:16:03+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/white-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL801_2BK-Lustra_LED_Pulsaris_24W_Acril_Negru_4000K_IP.20-2.webp?v=1763122563","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819201986827,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:55+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:16:03+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/white-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL801_2BK-Lustra_LED_Pulsaris_24W_Acril_Negru_4000K_IP.20-1.webp?v=1763122563","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51819201954059,"created_at":"2025-02-24T19:36:55+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:16:03+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/white-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL801_2BK-Lustra_LED_Pulsaris_24W_Acril_Negru_4000K_IP.20-3.webp?v=1763122563","width":900,"height":900},{"id":55010037006603,"created_at":"2025-04-26T22:22:00+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:16:03+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/black-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL801_2BK-LustraLEDPulsaris_24W_Acril_Negru_4000K_IP.20-1.png?v=1763122563","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":63232441417995,"created_at":"2025-12-10T13:16:51+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-12-10T13:16:55+02:00","product_id":9757934846219,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL801_2BK_EPREL.png?v=1765365415","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9758248501515,"title":"Lustra LED VICTORIA 19W, Rotunda, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Negru, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-victoria-19w-rotunda-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-negru-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:235\"\u003eLustra LED \u003cstrong\u003eVICTORIA\u003c\/strong\u003e este o piesă de iluminat modernă și compactă, cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e19W\u003c\/strong\u003e. Designul său este \u003cstrong\u003erotund\u003c\/strong\u003e, iar finisajul combină \u003cstrong\u003enegru și alb\u003c\/strong\u003e. Oferă posibilitatea de a alege între \u003cstrong\u003elumină rece, caldă sau neutră\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:462\"\u003eFiind o lustră de 19W, este ideală pentru a ilumina spații mai mici, cum ar fi holuri, băi, dressinguri sau ca sursă de lumină suplimentară în camere mai mari. Forma rotundă este versatilă și se integrează ușor în diverse stiluri de decor. Combinația de culori negru și alb creează un contrast clasic și elegant, adăugând o notă modernă oricărui interior. Posibilitatea de a schimba temperatura culorii îți permite să adaptezi atmosfera în funcție de preferințe.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:462\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ideala_pentru_Holuri.jpg?v=1741710546\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:14+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:13+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Aplicate","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED Scandinave","SUB50"],"variants":[{"id":52428745212171,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL700R","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"49.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"64.99","position":1,"product_id":9758248501515,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:26:20+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51820720947467,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:16+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-05-22T11:04:18+03:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-jazeera-16w-alb-negru_LL1870AL_02.webp?v=1779437058","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51820720914699,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:16+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-05-22T11:05:32+03:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-jazeera-16w-alb-negru_LL1870AL_01.webp?v=1779437132","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51820720816395,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:16+02:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-05-22T11:06:48+03:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-jazeera-16w-alb-negru_LL1870AL_03.webp?v=1779437208","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":51820720783627,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:16+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T21:00:17+02:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-jazeera-16w-alb-negru_LL1870AL_04.webp?v=1740423617","width":900,"height":900},{"id":66214845382923,"created_at":"2026-02-22T17:24:12+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2026-05-22T11:08:22+03:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL700R.webp?v=1779437302","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":62705650139403,"created_at":"2025-11-25T16:29:47+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-11-25T16:29:50+02:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LL700R_EPREL.png?v=1764080990","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":69658247397643,"created_at":"2026-07-03T11:15:03+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:15:16+03:00","product_id":9758248501515,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Lustra_LED_VICTORIA_19W_Rotunda_lumina_Rece_Calda_Neutra_Negru_Alb_1.jpg?v=1783066516","width":1254,"height":1254}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9758253744395,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu telecomanda NAOMI 72W,  Liniara, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu Lucios , Inaltime Reglabila","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-naomi-72w-liniara-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-auriu-lucios-inaltime-reglabila","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eAdăugați un element de sofisticare și stil în decorul dumneavoastră cu Lustra LED Naomi. Această lustră tip pendul, cu un design geometric și o finisare strălucitoare în auriu, este o alegere excelentă pentru a aduce un strop de eleganță modernă în orice spațiu. Cu o putere de 72W, o lungime de 90cm și o înălțime ajustabilă de până la 119cm, Naomi oferă o iluminare puternică și un impact vizual impresionant, fiind perfectă pentru livinguri, săli de mese sau holuri.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUnul dintre cele mai mari avantaje ale Lustrei LED Naomi este capacitatea sa de a fi dimabilă, oferindu-vă posibilitatea de a regla intensitatea luminii pentru a se potrivi cu diferite atmosfere și momente ale zilei. Controlul facil prin telecomandă adaugă un nivel suplimentar de confort și adaptabilitate, permițându-vă să schimbați setările de lumină cu ușurință.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDesignul său geometric, combinat cu finisajul auriu, adaugă un plus de rafinament și lux, transformând lustra într-un punct focal elegant și sofisticat. Fie că este folosită ca piesă centrală într-o încăpere sau ca un element complementar într-un decor mai amplu, Naomi se distinge prin stilul său contemporan și opulent.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCu un flux luminos de 4320lm, Lustra LED Naomi nu este doar o declarație de design, ci și o sursă eficientă de lumină, capabilă să ilumineze spații ample cu ușurință. Alegerea perfectă pentru cei care caută o combinație între funcționalitate, design modern și un strop de lux.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOptați pentru Lustra LED cu Telecomandă Naomi pentru a beneficia de un iluminat de înaltă calitate, care combină eficiența energetică cu un design modern și luxos. Este mai mult decât o sursă de lumină; este o piesă centrală care va îmbogăți și va lumina orice interior cu un aer de eleganță și rafinament.\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-30T03:07:19+03:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T21:01:21+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["All Stock","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Scandinave","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52408520376587,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-CH1A-HT2L-2210GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"139.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"299.99","position":1,"product_id":9758253744395,"created_at":"2025-09-24T13:44:07+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51820739363083,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:01:22+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T21:01:24+02:00","product_id":9758253744395,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-naomi-72w-acril-auriu_LL1574_01.webp?v=1740423684","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9758272651531,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda ABIGAIA 136W, 4 Elemente, Liniara, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-abigaia-136w-4-elemente-liniara-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:248\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă \u003cstrong\u003eABIGAIA\u003c\/strong\u003e este o piesă de iluminat modernă și puternică, cu o putere de \u003cstrong\u003e136W\u003c\/strong\u003e și un design format din \u003cstrong\u003e4 pătrate albe\u003c\/strong\u003e. Este echipată cu telecomandă, permițând controlul temperaturii culorii și intensității luminii.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:495\"\u003eCele \u003cstrong\u003epatru pătrate albe\u003c\/strong\u003e, aranjate probabil într-un mod dinamic sau estetic, sunt iluminate de LED-uri eficiente. Telecomanda inclusă îți oferă flexibilitate, permițându-ți să alegi între lumină \u003cstrong\u003erece, caldă sau neutră\u003c\/strong\u003e, adaptând atmosfera spațiului la nevoile tale. Funcția de \u003cstrong\u003edimare\u003c\/strong\u003e îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a crea ambianța perfectă. Finisajul \u003cstrong\u003ealb\u003c\/strong\u003e conferă lustrei un aspect curat, minimalist și versatil, ușor de integrat în diverse stiluri de interior.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:111\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:36+02:00","created_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:35+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED Cristal","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52428745244939,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-VV1A-HT2L-7217\/4","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"298.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"298.99","position":1,"product_id":9758272651531,"created_at":"2025-09-30T15:26:21+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":51820813254923,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:37+02:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:38+02:00","product_id":9758272651531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-abigaia-telecomanda-24ghz-136w-acril-alb_LL774_01.webp?v=1740423938","width":900,"height":900},{"id":51820813222155,"created_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:37+02:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-02-24T21:05:38+02:00","product_id":9758272651531,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/lustra-led-abigaia-telecomanda-24ghz-136w-acril-alb_LL774_02.webp?v=1740423938","width":900,"height":900}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":9758323933451,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda AMI 48W, 3 Inimi, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-ami-48w-3-inimi-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:319\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă AMI este o opțiune de iluminat adorabilă și modernă, perfectă pentru a adăuga o notă de originalitate și căldură oricărui spațiu. Cu o putere de 48W și un design inedit format din 3 inimi stilizate, în nuanța albă, această lustră îmbină un aspect jucăuș cu o tehnologie de iluminare versatilă.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:470\"\u003eCele trei inimi, iluminate eficient de LED-uri, nu sunt doar un element decorativ atrăgător, ci și surse de lumină ajustabilă. Prin intermediul telecomenzii, poți schimba temperatura culorii, alegând între lumină rece (pentru o atmosferă energizantă), caldă (pentru un ambient primitor și relaxant) sau neutră (pentru iluminare generală). Funcția de dimare îți oferă posibilitatea de a regla intensitatea luminii, adaptând-o la orice moment al zilei sau stare de spirit.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:275\"\u003eFinisajul alb al lustrei o face ușor de integrat în diverse stiluri de decor, adăugând o notă de puritate și luminozitate. Designul cu inimioare o face o alegere minunată pentru camere de copii, dormitoare sau orice spațiu în care se dorește o atmosferă prietenoasă și unică.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=