ideala pentru camerele de dimensiuni medii sau mici. Este prevazuta cu banda LED si functioneaza la o \u003cstrong data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"291\"\u003eputere de 26W\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferind o iluminare eficienta si economica. Este realizata din \u003cstrong data-is-only-node=\"\" data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"373\"\u003emetal\u003c\/strong\u003e, finisaj \u003cstrong data-end=\"401\" data-start=\"392\"\u003enegru\u003c\/strong\u003e, si se monteaza pe tavan prin \u003cstrong data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"432\"\u003eaplicare\u003c\/strong\u003e. Functioneaza la o \u003cstrong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"464\"\u003etensiune de 220–230V\u003c\/strong\u003e, avand o \u003cstrong data-end=\"519\" data-start=\"498\"\u003einaltime de 11 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e si un \u003cstrong data-end=\"547\" data-start=\"526\"\u003ediametru de 30 cm\u003c\/strong\u003e. Emite \u003cstrong data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"555\"\u003elumina calda, rece si neutra\u003c\/strong\u003e, fiind potrivita pentru \u003cstrong data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"612\"\u003ehol, dormitor sau living\u003c\/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong data-end=\"671\" data-start=\"642\"\u003eAutonomia este de 25.000h\u003c\/strong\u003e, iar \u003cstrong data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"677\"\u003eprotectia este de tip IP20\u003c\/strong\u003e, destinata utilizarii la \u003cstrong data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"733\"\u003einterior\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-23T14:28:17+03:00","created_at":"2025-03-06T18:45:20+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED","tags":["active","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED"],"variants":[{"id":52423674855691,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LL135B