"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"43762e04-713e-4aa3-8f1a-0179e3ea5a03\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"0\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLustra LED Lorenzo\u003c\/strong\u003e combină un design rafinat cu tehnologie inteligentă, fiind alegerea perfectă pentru interioare moderne. Realizată din metal și acril de calitate superioară, cu un finisaj elegant auriu, această piesă adaugă un accent decorativ spectaculos în living, dining sau dormitor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"383\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEchipată cu LED\u003c\/strong\u003e integrat dimabil și telecomandă, permite reglarea intensității luminii și a temperaturii de culoare: lumină \u003cstrong\u003ecaldă (3000K)\u003c\/strong\u003e pentru relaxare, \u003cstrong\u003eneutră (4000K)\u003c\/strong\u003e pentru activități zilnice sau \u003cstrong\u003erece (6000K)\u003c\/strong\u003e pentru concentrare.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"858\" data-start=\"617\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"617\"\u003eCaracteristici principale:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"647\"\u003e– Finisaj auriu modern, construcție din metal și acril\u003cbr data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"704\"\u003e– Intensitate reglabilă și 3 temperaturi de culoare\u003cbr data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"758\"\u003e– Control complet prin telecomandă inclusă\u003cbr data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e– Design eficient energetic, durată lungă de viață\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"860\"\u003eLustra Lorenzo oferă funcționalitate și estetică într-un singur corp de iluminat, redefinind atmosfera din orice spațiu.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mx-[var(--mini-thread-content-inset)]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aria-live=polite absolute\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-center\"\u003e\u003cbutton data-state=\"closed\" data-testid=\"copy-turn-action-button\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-label=\"Copy\" class=\"text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.