eutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-nolux-34w-patrata-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"248\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"248\"\u003eNOLUX \u003c\/strong\u003e impresionează prin arhitectura sa geometrică și finisajul alb imaculat. Cele trei pătrate suspendate creează un joc armonios de forme și lumină, ideal pentru interioare contemporane, minimaliste sau scandinave.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"475\"\u003eCu o putere de 34W și LED integrat, lustra oferă iluminare eficientă, reglabilă în intensitate și temperatură de culoare (rece, caldă sau neutră). Telecomanda inclusă îți permite să ajustezi atmosfera exact așa cum îți dorești, fie pentru relaxare, fie pentru activități intense.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:27:14+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-14T14:23:26+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52428513083659,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT630\/500P","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"169.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"179.99","position":1,"product_id":10132265435403,"created_at":"2025-09-30T14:07:54+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":59083964514571,"created_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:35+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:38+03:00","product_id":10132265435403,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H1b9fe32dbbbe4ace93b72f06124be10dR.jpg?v=1755093458","width":800,"height":800},{"id":59083964481803,"created_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:35+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:37+03:00","product_id":10132265435403,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Ha712bb9203cc42c2beb2648738b24f52f.jpg?v=1755093457","width":800,"height":800},{"id":59083964580107,"created_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:35+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-08-13T16:57:38+03:00","product_id":10132265435403,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H56c2d42a9a5f455a8f61881afb1a2033H.jpg?v=1755093458","width":756,"height":756},{"id":62529218183435,"created_at":"2025-11-20T18:15:44+02:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-11-20T18:15:47+02:00","product_id":10132265435403,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT630_500P_EPREL_278e663d-e720-41f1-b78b-9b8dd446b72f.png?v=1763655347","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10132314980619,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda  FUTURA LUMINA 66W, 2 Patrate, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-futura-lumina-66w-2-patrate-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"246\"\u003eCu un design geometric marcat de linii curate și unghiuri bine definite, FUTURA LUMINA adaugă o notă arhitecturală modernă oricărui spațiu. Cele două pătrate interconectate oferă un efect vizual elegant și dinamic, potrivit atât pentru livinguri, cât și pentru spații de birou.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"\" data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"529\"\u003ePuterea de 66W oferă iluminare eficientă, reglabilă în funcție de nevoie – de la o lumină caldă relaxantă până la una rece, perfectă pentru activități de precizie. Finisajul alb și forma minimalistă o fac ușor de integrat într-un decor contemporan.\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-04-29T15:27:51+03:00","created_at":"2025-04-14T14:43:56+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","NOSINC"],"variants":[{"id":52425977561355,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT631\/500P","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"169.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"179.99","position":1,"product_id":10132314980619,"created_at":"2025-09-30T01:07:50+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":59083777114379,"created_at":"2025-08-13T16:55:31+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-08-13T16:55:34+03:00","product_id":10132314980619,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hb9513710dd56461e8ab160ac0cfc5319g.jpg?v=1755093334","width":800,"h