oduct_id":10153227878667,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/white-AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT137GD_LustraLEDGinevracuTelecomanda_31W_LuminaRece_Calda_Neutra_Auriu-1.png?v=1753228972","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":57561400738059,"created_at":"2025-07-23T03:02:04+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-07-23T03:02:52+03:00","product_id":10153227878667,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a0e0f1d8-07e3-4797-8628-deb7a12c4d22_66860823-d345-486f-93e2-77ba3f19d60e.png?v=1753228972","width":2160,"height":2160},{"id":68425746678027,"created_at":"2026-04-22T13:43:26+03:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-04-22T13:43:29+03:00","product_id":10153227878667,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Label_2698627_big_color.svg?v=1776854609","width":136,"height":272}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10223736619275,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu Telecomanda NIVALIS 126W, Cercuri 40x60cm, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila,Inaltime Reglabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-fosco-126w-cercuri-40x60cm-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-inaltime-reglabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAceasta \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED cu telecomanda\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e are doua cercuri suspendate si o putere totala de 126W, oferind o iluminare eficienta, potrivita pentru incaperi precum \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elivingul\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ebucataria\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e sau zona de \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003edining\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. Cu un flux luminos de 10.080 lumeni, asigura lumina suficienta chiar si pentru spatii mai mari.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eTemperatura poate fi ajustata in 3 trepte (calda 3000K, neutra 4000K, rece 6000K), iar intensitatea este dimabila. Controlul se face atat din \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003etelecomanda\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, cat si de la \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eintrerupatorul clasic\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eFunctioneaza cu \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ebanda LED\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, are autonomie de 25.000 ore si se monteaza pe tavan. Finisajul auriu si forma rotunda o recomanda pentru cei care cauta o \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED pentru living\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e sau pentru spatii comune cu volum mare.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-06T14:39:35+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-06T14:31:49+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52429943210251,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT361\/60X40GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"599.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"599.99","position":1,"product_id":10223736619275,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:57:40+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56194787082507,"created_at":"2025-06-06T14:39:29+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-06T14:39:31+03:00","product_id":10223736619275,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT36160X40GD-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaFOSCO126W_luminaReceCaldaNeutra_Dimabila_InaltimeReglabila_Auriu-1.webp?v=1749209971","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10223760998667,"title":"Lustra LED suspendata cu Telecomanda NIVALIS Grand 480W, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila,Inaltime Reglabila, Auriu","handle":"lustra-led-suspendata-cu-telecomanda-nivalis-grand-480w-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-inaltime-reglabila-auriu","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eLustra LED cu telecomanda NIVALIS\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, formata din 6 cercuri suspendate vertical, este proiectata pentru incaperi inalte si spatioase – \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ecasa scarii\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elivinguri open-space\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ezona de dining\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. Cu o putere de 480W si un flux luminos de 38.400 lumeni, asigura iluminare uniforma si intensa pe toata inaltimea camerei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eTemperatura luminii poate fi schimbata rapid in 3 trepte – calda, neutra sau rece (3000K, 4000K, 6000K) – iar intensitatea este dimabila din \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003etelecomanda.\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e Functioneaza pe \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ebanda LED\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e si are o durata estimata de 25.000 de ore.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eFinisajul auriu si designul vertical o transforma intr-o \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elustra LED pentru casa scarii\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e eficienta si vizibil functionala, care se remarca fara a distrage atentia.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_20m2_generic.png?v=1745323363\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-06T15:07:08+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-06T14:51:44+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre Moderne","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52429943636235,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT363\/3000GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"1655.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"1821.00","position":1,"product_id":10223760998667,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:57:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56195094577419,"created_at":"2025-06-06T15:06:48+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-06T15:06:50+03:00","product_id":10223760998667,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT3633000GD-LustraLEDsuspendatacutelecomandaPINO480W_luminaReceCaldaNeutr