\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_138e0c95ae60d6d4\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:248\"\u003eLustra LED MARIA, o piesa de iluminat ce imbina estetica moderna cu functionalitatea avansata. Conceputa pentru a adauga o nota de rafinament, aceasta lustra este mai mult decat o sursa de lumina, este o declaratie de stil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"3:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:238\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign Inovator \u0026amp; Materiale de Calitate:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o forma liniara si finisaj auriu, realizata din acril si metal, lustra MARIA, cu cele 4 surse de lumina, se integreaza armonios in decorurile contemporane, aducand un plus de eleganta.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:270\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIluminare Versatila \u0026amp; Puternica:\u003c\/strong\u003e Beneficiati de o putere totala de 22W si un flux luminos generos de 7624lm. Alegeti din cele trei temperaturi de culoare (calda, neutra, rece) si controlati lumina intuitiv, fie prin intrerupatorul clasic, fie prin telecomanda.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEficienta Energetica \u0026amp; Durabilitate Extinsa:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tehnologia LED avansata asigura un consum optim si o durata de viata remarcabila de 25.000 de ore, oferind economii semnificative pe termen lung si o intretinere minima.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:238\"\u003eLustra LED MARIA este solutia ideala pentru cei ce cauta o iluminare eficienta, estetica si durabila, transformand fiecare incapere intr-un spatiu plin de personalitate si un confort vizual exceptional, perfect pentru dormitor sau living.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-footer gap has-thoughts complete\"\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\u003c!----\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2025-06-13T17:46:12+03:00","created_at":"2025-06-11T13:43:56+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda"],"variants":[{"id":52429945110795,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT720\/4GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"239.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"239.99","position":1,"product_id":10236926656779,"created_at":"2025-09-30T17:57:56+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":56383272648971,"created_at":"2025-06-13T17:54:45+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-13T17:54:47+03:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT7204-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaMARIA_4Elemente_44W_LuminaCaldaReceNeutra_AuriuNegru-1.png?v=1749826487","width":800,"height":800},{"id":56464681435403,"created_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:02+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:05+03:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT720_4-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaMARIA_4Elemente_44W_LuminaCalda_Rece_Neutra_Dimabila_Auriu_Negru.jpg?v=1750062725","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":56464681500939,"created_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:02+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:06+03:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT720_4-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaMARIA_4Elemente_44W_LuminaCalda_Rece_Neutra_Dimabila_Auriu_Negru_3.jpg?v=1750062726","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":56464681337099,"created_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:03+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:05+03:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT720_4-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaMARIA_4Elemente_44W_LuminaCalda_Rece_Neutra_Dimabila_Auriu_Negru_4.jpg?v=1750062725","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":56464681468171,"created_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:03+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-06-16T11:32:06+03:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/mockup-LT720_4-LustraLEDcuTelecomandaMARIA_4Elemente_44W_LuminaCalda_Rece_Neutra_Dimabila_Auriu_Negru_5.jpg?v=1750062726","width":1080,"height":1080},{"id":62880769212683,"created_at":"2025-11-30T13:35:13+02:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-11-30T13:35:17+02:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LT720_4GD_PREL.png?v=1764502517","width":2048,"height":2048},{"id":66211638477067,"created_at":"2026-02-22T16:45:13+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2026-02-22T16:45:16+02:00","product_id":10236926656779,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT720_4GD.webp?v=1771771516","width":1080,"height":1080}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10240952959243,"title":"Lustra LED cu Telecomanda GIO, 90W, 5 Elemente, Lumina Rece\/Clada\/Neutra, Dimabila, Alb","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-gio-90w-5-elemente-lumina-rece-clada-neutra-dimabila-alb","body_html":"\u003cdiv class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c3304092847-239\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c3304092847-239 has-thoughts\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"response-content ng-tns-c3304092847-239\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7e6f687547ca4d18\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:218\"\u003eLustra LED GIO, o declaratie de stil ce redefinedeste iluminatul modern. Aceasta piesa inovatoare este proiectata pentru a aduce lumina si eleganta, transformand orice spatiu intr-unul primitor si functional.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-sourcepos=\"3:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:277\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEstetica Avangardista \u0026amp; Materiale Durabile:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cu o geometrie liniara distincta si finisaj alb imaculat, construita meticulos din metal si aluminiu, aceasta lustra cu 5 surse LED adauga o nota de modernitate sculpturala, integrandu-se perfect in decorurile contemporane.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:318\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntensitate Luminoasa Remarcabila \u0026amp; Control Absolut:\u003c\/strong\u003e Experimenteaza un nivel superior de lumina cu o putere de 90W si un flux impresionant de 7200lm. Personalizeaza ambianta, alternand instantaneu intre nuante calde, neutre sau reci, avand control deplin prin intrerupatorul clasic sau telecomanda intuitiva.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:0\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInvestitie Inteligentă pe Termen Lung:\u003c\/strong\u003e Profita de eficienta energetica si fiabilitatea oferite de tehnologia LED, garantand o autonomie de 25.000 de ore. Aceasta inseamna costuri de operare minime si o solutie de iluminat fara griji pentru ani la rand.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:198\"\u003eLustra LED GIO este alegerea excelenta pentru oricine doreste sa imbunatateasca estetic si functional holul, bucataria sau livingul, creand o atmosfera impecabila si o experienta vizuala de neuitat.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\