wn prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"347\"\u003eLustra LED \u003cstrong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"78\"\u003e8057WH\u003c\/strong\u003e aduce un design modern și minimalist, cu finisaj elegant din \u003cstrong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"153\"\u003eacril alb\u003c\/strong\u003e, potrivit pentru orice tip de interior contemporan. Cu \u003cstrong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"229\"\u003e41W LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare puternică și uniformă, reglabilă pe trei trepte de temperatură a luminii: caldă, neutră și rece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"581\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"362\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 41W LED integrat\u003cbr data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"382\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"408\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K (caldă) \/ 4000K (neutră) \/ 6000K (rece)\u003cbr data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"457\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"472\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Acril + Metal\u003cbr data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"489\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"503\"\u003eFinisaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alb modern\u003cbr data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideală pentru living, dormitor, dining, birou\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"726\"\u003eLustra LED 8057WH combină eficiența energetică cu un design curat și versatil, oferind atât \u003cstrong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"694\"\u003efuncționalitate\u003c\/strong\u003e, cât și \u003cstrong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"723\"\u003eestetică modernă\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\u003cdiv aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edg