5-09-12T14:44:21+03:00","product_id":10721643266315,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPS_Photos_1_6fd153bc-cd0f-4c5a-abd1-36310eaf3eb5.png?v=1757677461","width":3000,"height":3000},{"id":60236978553099,"created_at":"2025-09-12T14:42:09+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T14:44:21+03:00","product_id":10721643266315,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a1_0f7d8044-d431-4e09-91e3-c92f2b2f905e.png?v=1757677461","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":60236978585867,"created_at":"2025-09-12T14:42:09+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T14:44:21+03:00","product_id":10721643266315,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a2_3ce71612-3809-4330-baf4-6d7a7420e4e7.png?v=1757677461","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":60236978618635,"created_at":"2025-09-12T14:42:09+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-12T14:44:21+03:00","product_id":10721643266315,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/a3_c95670cf-3b40-4311-ae78-928e69ce1223.png?v=1757677461","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":62528273023243,"created_at":"2025-11-20T16:01:35+02:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-11-20T16:01:38+02:00","product_id":10721643266315,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/8057WH_EPREL_259110c9-d339-4595-905c-6d6eb3a28c5f.png?v=1763647298","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10721747665163,"title":"Lustra LED Cristal cu Telecomanda LLC151\/500CH, 64W, 3 Elemente, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Crom Lucios","handle":"lustra-led-cristal-cu-telecomanda-llc151-500ch-64w-3-elemente-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-crom-lucios","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"400\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"145\"\u003eLLC151\/500CH 64W\u003c\/strong\u003e este o lustra LED cu design modern, compusă din 3 elemente elegante decorate cu cristale ce oferă un efect vizual rafinat. Finisajul crom lucios amplifică reflexia luminii, iar structura echilibrată (Ø 50 cm) o face potrivită pentru spații medii și mari.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3 data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"426\"\u003eSpecificații tehnice\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"777\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"439\"\u003eModel:\u003c\/strong\u003e LLC151\/500CH\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"489\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"489\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"468\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 64W (LED integrat)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"545\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"545\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"507\"\u003eTip lumină:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rece \/ Caldă \/ Neutră (selectabilă)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"594\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"594\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"567\"\u003eFuncție dimare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Da – reglare intensitate\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"631\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"631\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"609\"\u003eControl:\u003c\/strong\u003e Telecomandă inclusă\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"647\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + Cristal + dispersor acrilic\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"714\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"714\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"700\"\u003eCuloare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crom lucios\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"745\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"732\"\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 x 15 cm\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"777\"\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"777\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"759\"\u003eMontaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tavan (aplicat)\u003c\/p\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3 data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"811\"\u003eFuncționalități și beneficii\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"1074\"\u003e✔ Selectarea temperaturii de culoare pentru diferite momente ale zilei\u003cbr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"885\"\u003e✔ Intensitate reglabilă pentru confort vizual optim\u003cbr data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"939\"\u003e✔ Cristale decorative cu efect elegant de strălucire\u003cbr data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"994\"\u003e✔ Iluminare uniformă și eficientă energetic\u003cbr data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1040\"\u003e✔ Design modern cu impact vizual\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1403\"\u003ePrin combinația dintre tehnologia LED performantă și detaliile din cristal, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1284\"\u003eLLC151\/500CH 64W\u003c\/strong\u003e oferă un echilibru între funcționalitate și estetică premium, devenind un element central în amenajările contemporane.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led.webp?v=1734528553\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-10-21T21:35:12+03:00","created_at":"2025-09-12T16:43:39+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","All Stock","BF2025","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED \u0026 Cristale","Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","Lustre LED Suspendate"],"variants":[{"id":52412037890315,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LLC151\/500CH","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"339.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"539.99","position":1,"product_id":10721747665163,"created_at":"2025-09-25T15:52:42+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":60332562448651,"created_at":"2025-09-15T12:48:11+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hee6b23c84b9d4a44af7ef59ba4eb4a7aE.jpg?v=1757929962","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":60332562579723,"created_at":"2025-09-15T12:48:12+03:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/Hc90d939695494dd9b68c4bc2b3aba90eh.jpg?v=1757929962","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":60237878493451,"created_at":"2025-09-12T16:44:18+03:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_1_78913bb4-8247-49ae-bcb2-b94fb84bc4f6.png?v=1757929962","width":800,"height":800},{"id":60332561826059,"created_at":"2025-09-15T12:48:10+03:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H0c24f167dce04d7c9236bcb85507ba6f2.jpg?v=1757929962","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":60332562383115,"created_at":"2025-09-15T12:48:11+03:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/H81fc2ab0b4244aa4a48dd60fc90ddd10D.jpg?v=1757929962","width":1600,"height":1600},{"id":60237878526219,"created_at":"2025-09-12T16:44:18+03:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2025-09-15T12:52:42+03:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/WPSPhotos_2_63f4cebd-1919-49e5-b755-85ff0deab04a.png?v=1757929962","width":800,"height":800},{"id":62527257379083,"created_at":"2025-11-20T14:53:19+02:00","position":7,"updated_at":"2025-11-20T14:53:23+02:00","product_id":10721747665163,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/LLC151_500CH_EPREL_6404d449-b8b9-48be-80db-e2182a57fb6f.png?v=1763643203","width":2048,"height":2048}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":10730348806411,"title":"Lustra LED cu telecomanda BETTY 81W, 6 Cercuri, lumina Rece\/Calda\/Neutra, Dimabila, Auriu Lucios","handle":"lustra-led-cu-telecomanda-betty-81w-6-cercuri-lumina-rece-calda-neutra-dimabila-auriu-lucios","body_html":"\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:279\"\u003eLustra LED cu telecomandă BETTY este o piesă de iluminat modernă și elegantă, cu un design format din 6 cercuri interconectate, finisate într-un auriu lucios care adaugă o notă de lux și căldură. Cu o putere de 81W, oferă o iluminare versatilă și eficientă pentru diverse spații.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:474\"\u003eCele 6 cercuri, dispuse probabil într-o manieră care creează un ansamblu vizual dinamic și echilibrat, sunt iluminate de LED-uri cu posibilitatea de a selecta temperatura culorii. Prin intermediul telecomenzii, poți alege între lumină rece (pentru un ambient energizant), caldă (pentru o atmosferă primitoare și relaxantă) sau neutră (pentru iluminare generală). Funcția de dimare îți permite să ajustezi intensitatea luminii pentru a se potrivi perfect oricărui moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:262\"\u003eFinisajul auriu lucios al lustrei accentuează liniile moderne ale designului circular și adaugă o notă de opulență și stil încăperii. Această combinație de formă geometrică și culoare caldă o face potrivită pentru interioare moderne, clasice sau chiar eclectice.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:262\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/telecomanda-banner.jpg?v=1742391439\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/noapte-banner.jpg?v=1742391487\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_lumina_rece_calda_neutra_lustra_led.webp?v=1734526074\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-11-20T12:51:02+02:00","created_at":"2025-09-22T13:04:56+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00","vendor":"Alessandro Design","product_type":"Lustre LED cu Telecomanda","tags":["active","CH_ONLINE-MASS","Corpuri de Iluminat","Lustre LED","Lustre LED Aplicate"],"variants":[{"id":52401083613451,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"AT1CT-IM1P-HT2L-LT800\/6GD","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":false,"price":"179.99","grams":0,"compare_at_price":"199.99","position":1,"product_id":10730348806411,"created_at":"2025-09-22T13:26:22+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-14T13:12:21+03:00"}],"images":[{"id":60558691205387,"created_at":"2025-09-22T13:08:11+03:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-22T13:22:26+03:00","product_id":10730348806411,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.