=\"377\" data-start=\"76\"\u003ePlafoniera LED PL102 aduce un design modern și minimalist, cu finisaj \u003cstrong data-end=\"171\" data-start=\"156\"\u003ealb elegant\u003c\/strong\u003e, ideal pentru interioare luminoase. Cu \u003cstrong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"211\"\u003e51W LED integrat\u003c\/strong\u003e, oferă o iluminare eficientă și uniformă, disponibilă pe trei trepte de temperatură a luminii: \u003cstrong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"327\"\u003e3000K (caldă), 4000K (neutră), 6000K (rece)\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"624\" data-start=\"379\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"381\"\u003ePutere:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50W LED integrat\u003cbr data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"409\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"429\" data-start=\"414\"\u003eDimensiuni:\u003c\/strong\u003e Diametru 40 cm\u003cbr data-end=\"447\" data-start=\"444\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"449\"\u003eTemperatură culoare:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 6000K\u003cbr data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"495\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"513\" data-start=\"500\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal + Acril\u003cbr data-end=\"530\" data-start=\"527\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"532\"\u003eFinisaj:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alb modern\u003cbr data-end=\"558\" data-start=\"555\"\u003e✔ \u003cstrong data-end=\"574\" data-start=\"560\"\u003eUtilizare:\u003c\/strong\u003e Living, dormitor, dining, birou, spații moderne\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-end=\"766\" data-start=\"626\"\u003eAceastă plafonieră LED combină \u003cstrong data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"657\"\u003eeficiența energetică\u003c\/strong\u003e cu un design elegant, fiind soluția ideală pentru iluminarea contemporană a casei.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003cp data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:184\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0782\/5175\/3739\/files\/banner_general_lustre_led_10m.webp?v=1741780801\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at"